# Working directory. Ignored by default, but the capture files the public docs
# quote are allow-listed below so a reader can open them: DEMO_SCRIPT.md quotes
# every on-screen line out of one of these, and scripts/make_demo_video.py
# refuses to render when a quoted line has drifted from its capture. Nothing is
# allow-listed by pattern -- each published file is named, so a new capture stays
# private until it is deliberately listed.
scratch/*
